---
// Matchday / GWD Sports section
---

<section class="sec" id="matchday">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="eyebrow">Real-world execution · On the ground</p>
        <h2 class="h2">Live matchdays, run by student interns.</h2>
        <div class="body">
          <p>Through GWD Sports, the club's interns work inside a major tournament, the Hyderabad Super League. They run the workflows that keep a matchday on schedule, operate the live stream and film the game.</p>
          <p>It is the same standard a paid crew works to, with students holding the controls.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="roles">
          <article class="role" data-index="0">
            <p class="mono">Operations</p>
            <h3>Matchday workflow management</h3>
            <p>Kick-off timings, team sheets, crew positions and the handoffs between them.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="role" data-index="1">
            <p class="mono">Broadcast</p>
            <h3>OBS live streaming</h3>
            <p>Scenes, overlays, camera and audio feeds, and the switching between them while the match is live.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="role" data-index="2">
            <p class="mono">Camera</p>
            <h3>Cinematography</h3>
            <p>Match coverage and highlight footage shot for the stream and the league's channels.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="tags">
          <span class="chip accent">GWD Sports</span>
          <span class="chip">Hyderabad Super League</span>
          <span class="chip">Student interns</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-stage">
        <div class="stage" data-stage="pitch" role="img" aria-label="A pitch in 3D with moving players, a ball and three cameras whose sight lines follow the ball">
          <p class="cap">Three cameras track the ball</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
